        </h2>
        <p>
          Headlines in international financial media proclaimed that Portugal "ended all tax incentives." This is inaccurate. While the general 0% tax holiday on passive foreign dividends under the 2009 regime closed to new entrants, the Portuguese government specifically replaced it with Article 58-A of the Tax Benefits Code: the <strong>Incentivo Fiscal à Investigação Científica e Inovação (IFICI)</strong>.
        </p>

